'''Slime Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]] who can be unlocked when beating the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[I'll Be Bug (Merciless)|The Old Queen]] appearing on the '''1st''', '''2nd''', '''15th''' and '''16th''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] increases speed, range and [[Wave Attack]] level.

